      "bodyHtml": "<!--fb-gallery--><div class=\"is-container-in\"><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column full\"><h1 class=\"size-48 is-title1-48 is-title-bold\">113學測 壓軸題選填P17</h1></div></div><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column half\"><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">獵豹總是與眾不同：</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>別人兩頁 獵豹一行‼️</strong></span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>一線定江山👍👍👍</strong></span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">✅索取宗翰老師解說影片方式:</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">書面解說文</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>3. 完成google表單填寫並告知星媽</strong></span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong>4. 進line群等候本週末發布影片</strong></span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">《高中數學進度S系列課程》</span></p></div></div><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column full\"><img src=\"pic/columns/cheetah-salon-1424064391879575-1.jpg\" alt=\"113學測 壓軸題選填P17\"></div></div></div>",
