      "excerpt": "在Pyhä-Luosto 國家公園的森林漫步，遇見柳雷鳥。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.cheetahstem.com/news_detail/244",
      "coverImage": "pic/columns/2023090113313666666.png",
