      "summary": "AMC是檢測邏輯思維的考試。",
      "excerpt": "AMC是檢測邏輯思維的考試。",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.cheetahstem.com/news_detail/130",
      "coverImage": "pic/columns/2023080508161169202.png",
