      "summary": "宗翰老師對孩子的講話: 有意義的學習 必須是讓學習者「掙扎」與「突破」！",
      "excerpt": "宗翰老師對孩子的講話: 有意義的學習 必須是讓學習者「掙扎」與「突破」！",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.cheetahstem.com/news_detail/175",
      "coverImage": "pic/columns/20220125120351cyf3m.jpg",
      "detailImages": [],
      "cover": "pic/columns/20220125120351cyf3m.jpg",
      "imageName": "20220125120351cyf3m.jpg",
