      "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"is-container-in\">\n<div class=\"remote-row clearfix\">\n<div class=\"column half\">\n<h3 class=\"big-one-two\">用程式軟體玩數學</h3>\n\n<p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"></span><br />\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">獵豹x朱安強博士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><br />\n<br />\nGGB寒假密集基礎班 一小時體驗課免費分享<br />\nYT網址：<a href=\"https://youtu.be/_MKNGq6M9vM?fbclid=IwAR0zY6CM0h3Zq1TdxyBVh4Yj-PH0vH01CqGtrDUThM4tmBg7IFA7zbDvRAQ\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/_MKNGq6M9vM</a></span></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"column half\">\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-4by3\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_MKNGq6M9vM?rel=0\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"remote-row clearfix\">\n<div class=\"column full\">\n<p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">GeoGebra是小學高年級學生同時學習數學與程式設計思維的最佳課程<br />\n目前已經開始報名<br />\n<br />\n報名鏈結：<a href=\"https://ap5.ragic.com/cheetahmath/sales/45?webview&amp;webaction=form&amp;ver=new&amp;dfCheckbox&amp;fbclid=IwAR3CW14jPdZhl1_rgT8hf4-2LFspy2FKeZLRjGXF5CMRUa1PW3YhPN7c--w\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\">https://ap5.ragic.com/cheetahmath/sales/45?webview......</a><br />\n想要了解課程的家長同學，請上YT親自體驗</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"normal-txt\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/695697124716309/permalink/935209790765040/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/695697124716309/permalink/935209790765040/</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
