      "summary": "台灣年輕一輩傑出的統計學家",
      "excerpt": "台灣年輕一輩傑出的統計學家",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.cheetahstem.com/news_detail/149",
      "coverImage": "pic/columns/2023081001311038396.png",
